    "mage_root": {
        "title": "The Mage's Calling",
        "icon": {
            "type": "item",
            "data": {
                "item": "nether_star"
            }
        },
        "description": [
            "Magic is neither innate nor inherited. It is a discipline of observation, repetition, and restraint. Those who devote themselves to its study often neglect the pursuits of body in favor of mind.\n\n",
            "Starting Spell Granted: Magic Missile\n\n",
            "Passive Ability Unlocked: Arcane Poise\n",
            "-> Arcane conductivity decreases as physical encumbrance increases.\n",
            "-> Encumbrance = Armor + (2 × Armor Toughness)\n",
            "-> Light Equipment: +5% Spell Power, +5% Mana Regeneration, +5% Cast Time Reduction\n",
            "-> Medium Equipment: No bonuses and no penalties\n",
            "-> Heavy Equipment: -10% Mana Regeneration, -10% Cast Time Reduction, +10% Mana Cost\n",
            "-> Spell-Sword rewrites Arcane Poise upon subclass selection rather than gradually mitigating its penalties.\n\n",
            "Other Bonuses:\n",
            "Spell Power +3%\n",
            "Maximum Mana +20\n",
            "Mana Regeneration +5%\n",
            "Armor -2\n",
            "Maximum Health -2\n",
            "Mining Speed -10%"
